    "title":  "Waking Nightmare",
    "description":  "The people of Dawnstar suffer from nightmares caused by Vaermina\u0027s Skull of Corruption hidden within Nightcaller Temple. Aid the priest Erandur in destroying the artifact, or claim it for yourself.",
